      "text": "At ₹2,433 (NSE close, 16 Nov 2026), the reinvestment-phase discounted cash flow model (Template B, since MPHASIS's median return on invested capital of 23.4% is above its 12.12% cost of capital) matches the price if revenue grows about 24.4% a year for five years at the FY26 operating margin of 15.3%; MPHASIS's revenue grew 4.8% a year over FY23–FY26.",
